Package: SSGGP
Title: Sparse Spectral Graphical Gaussian Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anonymous", "Authors", email = "anonymous@example.invalid",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Penalized likelihood inference for highly-multivariate Gaussian
    processes via random Fourier features and sparse spectral graphical
    modelling. Provides simulation, estimation and prediction for a model in
    which process-level conditional independence is encoded as zeros in the
    inverse cross-spectral density. Estimation uses a stochastic approximation
    EM algorithm with a graphical LASSO penalty, with a coordinate-wise
    expectation/conditional-maximization update for the process-specific
    spectral parameters.
